return {["zone1_guard5_greetings"]="Honor and tradition? Ha! The Order is merely a playground for me, a minor amusement, a way to hone my already impressive sword skills.",
["zone1_guard5_greetings2"]="And I am more than happy to show my skills to you now.",
["zone1_lynx_greetings"]="You think defeating my guards proves your strength? They were weaklings, pawns, easily forgotten and replaced.",
["zone1_lynx_greetings2"]="But the Order has need of one with your skill, your drive. You must choose: join us or suffer.",
["zone2_begin_1"]="This town was known for its fighting schools, yet it lies in ruin! So much destruction... what could have done this?",
["zone2_begin_2"]="Let's find someone who can tell us what's happened. There's a young man over there; maybe he can help.",
["zone2_begin_3"]="You! Tell us: what's happening here?",
["zone2_begin_4"]="You're here for Hermit's competition, no doubt. Stand in line, though you'll never get a chance to try.",
["zone2_guard1_defeated"]="I can't believe you beat me... Hermit came here with nothing, yet built the best fighting school in the east!",
["zone2_guard1_defeated2"]="Perhaps... humility is the lesson I must learn if I am to ever open my own school.",
["zone2_guard1_greetings"]="I am the true chosen one; the only one worthy of Hermit's teachings. I will prove it and then open my own school. Prepare yourself for defeat!",
["zone2_guard2_defeated1"]="You beat me – so what? Competitions are for fools, not real warriors. The only way to truly earn Hermit's knowledge is to take it by force!",
["zone2_guard2_defeated2"]="You seem like a smart fighter. Want a leg up in the competition? I know Hermit's secret. You can have it... for a price.",
["zone2_guard2_defeated2_accept"]="Excellent doing business with you. You won't regret it. I'll be back in a bit for delivery.",
["zone2_guard2_defeated2_reject"]="Time is money, and you've just cost me both. Oh well, it's your loss.",
["zone2_guard2_greetings"]="Look at the destruction one old man has brought. Imagine what I'll do with such power. Get out of my way; I must get Hermit's secret knowledge!",
["zone2_guard3_defeated1"]="Heed my warnings! Magic has no place in martial arts. It dirties the mind, clouds the focus, and in the wrong hands it can bring destruction and despair.",
["zone2_guard3_defeated2"]="Magic! So that is Hermit's great secret. Beware, my apprentice, magic is dangerous and powerful. It should not be used!",
["zone2_guard3_defeated3"]="Sensei is right, Shadow. Magic is too dangerous to allow just anyone to have it. But you... imagine what you'll be capable of with such a power!",
["zone2_guard3_greetings"]="No one should posses such power. This competition is pointless. I will win and the secret will end with me.",
["zone2_guard4_defeated"]="There is no shame in being bested by a good soldier.",
["zone2_guard4_greetings"]="War is the only constant – with Hermit's magic, I will conquer all who oppose me... starting with you! ",
["zone2_guard5_defeated1"]="Crane, how far you have fallen. What have you become? Forsaking the old ways? Forgetting all I have taught you? Shame on you!",
["zone2_guard5_defeated2"]="Forgive me, Sensei. I have brought shame to you and to myself. Your apprentice has shown me the error of my ways.",
["zone2_guard5_greetings"]="Sensei, my old teacher. Come to witness the new way? Your teachings are outdated, unimaginative! And this new apprentice... weak and unworthy!",
["zone2_hermit_greetings"]="Could you be the one I have been waiting for? Let us test your skills!",
["zone2_hermit_won"]="You lack focus! Pay attention now and try again.",
["zone3_begin_1"]="Hey, guys! How's it going? I'm Bird, it's nice to meet you. Welcome to our little town.",
["zone3_begin_2"]="How strange for this girl to walk alone at night, talking to strangers. I have a bad feeling about this.",
["zone3_begin_3"]="Don't be so worried, old man! There's nothing fishy going on here. She's just being friendly!",
["zone3_butcher_greetings"]="Only the strongest survive! I teach them, train them, raise them to cut and shred! Meddling fools – now I'll teach you a different lesson!",
["zone3_butcher_won"]="You'll return over and over again until I spill every last drop of your blood. Bring it on!",
["zone3_guard1_defeated"]="Please don't hurt me! I just got mixed up with the wrong people, that's all. Let me go and I promise to stop tricking travelers.",
["zone3_guard1_greetings"]="Wanna see some sights? I'll show you my favorite part of town first – it'll take your breath away... once and for all.",
["zone3_guard2_defeated1"]="Please have mercy! Butcher doesn't know about our relationship. He thinks love makes you weak. Please don't tell him about us!",
["zone3_guard2_defeated2"]="Your fight with Hermit destroyed my business! Now everyone knows the secret.",
["zone3_guard2_defeated3"]="I'll have to think of a new plan... I'll have plenty of time for that. A ship awaits me. Farewell.",
["zone3_guard2_greetings"]="No; you've hurt Bird! You will pay for what you've done to my love!",
["zone3_guard3_defeated"]="I don't understand. Why didn't anyone come to my aid? Could it be that Butcher... used me? No. No, I refuse to believe it!",
["zone3_guard3_greetings"]="Butcher is our leader, our guiding star. Even more, he raised me from a little boy. I owe him everything. We all do!",
["zone3_guard4_defeated1"]="It used to be all about having fun, breaking rules, being young. But things have changed so much. This... cult... is too serious. It's not fun anymore.",
["zone3_guard4_defeated2"]="Hermit warned us about Butcher's gang, but this... this is much worse. He has been misleading children, turning them, building his own private army!",
["zone3_guard4_defeated3"]="That's disgusting! How could he do such a thing? Give me your sword and I'll kill him myself!",
["zone3_guard4_greetings"]="You've met Bull, that worthless fool? It was Butcher himself that killed his parents. I always thought it was a mistake letting that little brat live.",
["zone3_guard5_defeated"]="My defeat means nothing. This island will be your grave. Butcher will take your life away.",
["zone3_guard5_greetings"]="I hear the gentle whisper of your blood speaking to me. Come, and I will free it from that confining cocoon.",
["zone4_begin_1"]="Have you heard anything about the place we are heading? Who is in charge?",
["zone4_begin_2"]="Of course I've heard! Some time ago the Pirate King disappeared. His daughter, Wasp, took over and now controls this harbor.",
["zone4_begin_3"]="It's said Wasp has a magic amulet which brings luck to its owner...",
["zone4_begin_4"]="An amulet, you say? That sounds familiar. I wonder if that's the item we've been searching for...",
["zone4_begin_5"]="Getting to Wasp won't be easy. She's had some trouble recently and has gone into hiding. Anyway, not my problem. A job awaits! Good luck!",
["zone4_guard1_defeated"]="So, you're a tough one, eh? Let's see how far you get...",
["zone4_guard1_defeated2"]="Ah, so you've met these \"New Blood\" fellas. Some of Wasp's crewmen mutinied and took over her ships.",
["zone4_guard1_defeated3"]="She's got a few loyal henchmen by her side, but they're still in hiding... oh, I should be going!",
["zone4_guard1_defeated4"]="I saw you deal with that mutineer bilge rat Kraken. You know, Wasp could use a warrior like you.",
["zone4_guard1_defeated5"]="Deal with the rest of those New Blood fools and the captain will make you rich!",
["zone4_guard1_greetings"]="Who the hell are you? This port is closed. But... You've got a nice ship there – I claim it in the name of New Blood!",
["zone4_guard2_defeated"]="You've chosen the wrong side, lad. When Wasp is through with you, you'll disappear just like her father! Mark my words!",
["zone4_guard2_greetings"]="The Pirate King disappears without a trace, Wasp takes over, and nobody asks where her father went!",
["zone4_guard2_greetings2"]="She had something to do with it, I tell ya. I don't trust that wench, and neither should you!",
["zone4_guard3_defeated"]="Your strength belongs with New Blood! The Pirate King disappeared because of his ungrateful daughter – and you’re helping spread her lies!",
["zone4_guard3_greetings"]="Wasp's old dogs sent you, eh? They put their money on the wrong guy. I’ll hoist you over the yardarm and you’ll sink like all the rest! ",
["zone4_guard4_defeated"]="We stand to lose this war because of the likes of you. Brothers killing brothers, and you profit from their suffering. You won't leave this city alive!",
["zone4_guard4_greetings"]="So, you've dealt with the mutineers and have come for your reward?",
["zone4_guard4_greetings2"]="Wasp was going to give you an audience until she saw you with that petty profiteer Sly! He's been selling weapons to New Blood!",
["zone4_guard4_greetings3"]="Sly! Is this true? Have you armed their enemies?",
["zone4_guard4_greetings4"]="I can explain everything! But now isn't the time... can you help a friend out here?",
["zone4_guard5_defeated"]="If only the Pirate King were here – none of this would be happening! Damn that girl and her selfish acts!",
["zone4_guard5_greetings"]="What's that silly girl gotten herself into now? If it weren't for me, Wasp would be long dead. You're just another mess for me to clean up!",
["zone4_wasp_greetings"]="I should thank you, honestly. Before you came, I had two problems: the mutineers and my so-called \"advisors\" trying to restrict my control.",
["zone4_wasp_greetings2"]="But now, thanks to you, I'm the only one in power here!",
["zone4_wasp_won"]="That’s it? That’s all you’ve got? Weak! Get up and fight me for real... if you can!",
["zone5_begin_1"]="Well, what do we have here? An interesting specimen... I've met so many men, so boring, so average. ",
["zone5_begin_2"]="But... There's something peculiar about this one. I'll keep my eye on you.",
["zone5_begin_3"]="An interesting specimen? She's so full of herself! Shadow is above flattery.",
["zone5_begin_4"]="She must be the woman Wasp spoke of. Something is... bothering me, but I am not sure what.",
["zone5_begin_5"]="She doesn't scare me... but all these bodies do. My God, it's a slaughterhouse! And look at the damage from the siege engines!",
["zone5_guard1_defeated1"]="I came as a marauder, but something changed. There's a light in my heart for Widow. But I failed. I... I am not worthy of her affection.",
["zone5_guard1_defeated2"]="I can't forget that beautiful woman! Her face is all I see when I close my eyes.",
["zone5_guard1_defeated3"]="I spent all my money on a gift for her – surely, these precious gems will tell her how I feel about her.",
["zone5_guard1_defeated4"]="You did what? Are you feeling all right?",
["zone5_guard1_defeated5"]="Am I all... No! No, I'm not all right! What's happening to me? This is maddening!",
["zone5_guard1_greetings"]="Widow is my goddess! I would give all the riches in the world just to see her smile at me.",
["zone5_guard1_greetings2"]="I saw the way you were looking at her... her face will be the last thing you ever see!",
["zone5_guard2_defeated"]="She came from nowhere as we hunted. We were dumbstruck. When I finally came to my senses, blood stained my hands, and my brothers were no more...",
["zone5_guard2_defeated2"]="All these men are vying for Widow's affection. But they're not thinking straight – they've been charmed. That's why they're attacking!",
["zone5_guard2_defeated3"]="Sly's gone mad, too. But, Sensei, why doesn't it affect you?",
["zone5_guard2_defeated4"]="I feel her pull, too, but I am skilled enough to resist the power.",
["zone5_guard2_greetings"]="I'm the last of my tribe. The spirits showed me the way to the most miraculous woman I've ever seen.",
["zone5_guard2_greetings2"]="I sacrificed much to attract her attention; I can't allow you to steal her from me now!",
["zone5_guard3_defeated"]="Am I cursed? Love has driven me to madness and brought me to my knees, turning me into a mindless youth.",
["zone5_guard3_defeated2"]="But my body can't keep up with my ambitions. I'm just a lonely, pathetic, old man.",
["zone5_guard3_greetings"]="Maybe I'm not as young or strong as I used to be, but my experience will win over your arrogance! The woman will be mine.",
["zone5_guard4_defeated"]="She has a strange power over men, beyond her beauty – it's magic! I can't resist, but I see her true nature.",
["zone5_guard4_defeated2"]="She is cruel and evil. I'm begging you: free me from this misery!",
["zone5_guard4_greetings"]="You'll go no farther. Widow has chosen me as her favored watchdog, and I am to stop anyone from coming to see her. Prepare to feel my fists!",
["zone5_guard5_defeated"]="You're a perfect representative of your kind – vain and self-satisfied!",
["zone5_guard5_defeated2"]="Widow will punish you and turn you into her favorite little toy. Mark my words!",
["zone5_guard5_greetings"]="I don't need some magic spell to love Widow. Her power over men excites me.",
["zone5_guard5_greetings2"]="Love is the perfect way to rob you men of your free will. But somehow you're beyond her control... so I'll fix it!",
["zone5_widow_greetings"]="Such a powerful young man – you'll be a perfect addition to my collection.",
["zone5_widow_greetings2"]="Fight my magic all you want; I like the struggle. No matter, I'll win and you'll stay by my side forever!",
["zone5_widow_won"]="I'll be here when you're ready to try again. A worthy adversary such as yourself... we could be good friends. Or perhaps more?",
["zone6_begin_5"]="It will be full of trickery and illusion. Take care, my disciple, and be ready for anything.",
["zone6_guard4_greetings"]="You should have never returned, Prince. Did you think your former subjects would submit to you after what you did?",
["zone6_guard4_greetings2"]="Your highborn head has no place here, except on the end of a pike!",
["zone6_guard5_defeated"]="I know you have no mercy for the defeated, Prince.",
["zone6_guard5_defeated2"]="But whatever torture you've prepared, it will not compare to the fate awaiting those who fail to carry out Shogun's will.",
["zone6_shogun_defeated_2"]="They used your name to scare children, yes. But I brought them order; I gave them the Empire! My people won't follow a petty prince now...",
["zone6_start_dialog_sensei_2"]="Perhaps, but we must be careful. No natural fire can burn so long; this realm belongs to the shadows now.",
