["zone7_c1_arrival1"]="Weapons down. Come with me. Titan awaits your arrival.",
["zone7_c1_shroud_fightend1"]="Glad I made it in time! Get up; we must leave quickly. Shroud will not stay unconscious for long!",
["zone7_c1_shroud_fightend2"]="My name's Kali. Pleased to meet you... Shadow? That's an interesting name. Come on, I'll take you somewhere safe.",
["zone7_c1_shroud_fightend3"]="Who have you brought here, Kali? Did you forget we're in hiding?",
["zone7_c1_shroud_fightend4"]="Listen, Cypher! This is Shadow; I saw him come through the Gates, and he's still alive. It's a miracle! But Shroud was his welcoming committee.",
["zone7_c1_shroud_fightend5"]="Shroud himself? Interesting... So, Shadow, you must be quite important to Titan if he sent his best fighter to fetch you. That makes you important to us, too.",
["zone7_c1_shroud_fightend6"]="You should rest here. We can't allow you to leave the compound just yet, for your own safety... and ours.",
["zone7_c1_shroud_fightend7"]="Kali, give our guest a tour. We will speak later.",
["zone7_c1_tournament_begin1"]="Here you'll meet heroes from innumerable planes. They found themselves stuck here after Titan annexed their worlds, adding them to his vast domain.",
["zone7_c1_tournament_begin2"]="Cypher managed to unite them under his command, but they can be difficult to deal with. You'll have to earn their respect.",
["zone7_c1_survival_begin1"]="There's a looters' camp not far from here. There might be something useful there, but the camp is heavily guarded. Will you help?",
["zone7_c1_tournament_lecture1_1"]="Titan never conquered a world without resistance. Each time a champion arises to stop him.",
["zone7_c1_tournament_lecture1_2"]="But every champion has failed - and after that, another world followed his fate. I saw that with my own eyes.",
["zone7_c1_tournament_lecture2_1"]="Shroud was once such a champion. He lost, and compromised with his conscience. Titan spared his life, but made a faithful slave out of him.",
["zone7_c1_tournament_lecture2_2"]="You don't yet understand what you're dealing with, boy. Titan is a monster, a parasite for whom life itself means nothing.",
["zone7_c1_cypher_fightenter1"]="Your fight against Titan is inevitable, but the outcome is not predetermined. You will need more than just your strength. Show me all you've got!",
["zone7_c1_cypher_fightend1"]="You're strong, capable. But Titan is no simple brute. He can harrow your mind, leaving no chance to defend. His will turns into your will. But there's a way.",
["zone7_c1_cypher_fightend2"]="Before Titan came, an ancient tribe lived here. Their wills were strong. He was unable to turn them into his mindless soldiers, so he ordered their destruction.",
["zone7_c1_cypher_fightend3"]="But one of these ancients escaped and hid... somewhere. I tried to use Cronos, my greatest creation, to find him.",
["zone7_c1_cypher_fightend4"]="Oh, I remember that one. He returned insane, and then just ran away again. That was a real mess...",
["zone7_c1_cypher_fightend5"]="The ancient one is powerful. He wiped Cronos' memory, replacing it with an idea to cleanse this world of all vices. He's likely near one of Titan's factories.",
["zone7_c1_cypher_fightend6"]="So, it seems that Cronos is our best chance at finding the ancient one. Let's go!",
["zone7_c1_cronos_fightenter1"]="How dare you approach the voice of the ancients? Their ghosts scream in anger over Titan's foul touch upon their once beautiful land! Show your true face, beast!",
["zone7_c1_cronos_fightend1"]="Well, he's switched off. Let me check his memory chip. And... Done! The ancient one is in the Stone Grove. It's a real tomb, but we have no choice. Let's go!",
["zone7_c1_shroud_ambush1"]="No. It can't be him! This must be some kind of trap!",
["zone7_c1_shroud_ambush2"]="So, you've finally come to face me. I've been waiting for you, Shadow. We have unfinished business to attend to.",
["zone7_c1_final"]="What fate is in store for Shadow? Will he defeat Titan and rescue May? Find out in the second chapter in early 2015!",
["zone7_denomination1"]="What’s that? Some kind of money from your world? Funny. But they’re nothing but junk here. Our coins are different. Here, take some as my gift.",
