["zone7_c3_begin1"]="Long time no see, dear friend. The Gates are closed, so - you want more? You want to take Titan's place, don't you?",
["zone7_c3_begin2"]="And who's that? A new girlfriend already? Titan was right! You're not \"saving the world\". Chicks and power, that's all you want! Why else would you climb in here?",
["zone7_c3_begin3"]="Don't be silly. I am not his \"girlfriend\", I am his liaison officer. And he's here for you!",
["zone7_c3_begin4"]="For me? What do you know about it?! He's not... But... are you... serious?",
["zone7_c3_begin5"]="Attention, Justice! We demand your surrender! I have restored the Hideout's internal defense circuit; you have no other options!",
["zone7_c3_begin6"]="Argh! Damn you, rebel! Damn you, Shadow! All that talk was just to trick me! But Titan will come! Titan will tear your heads off!",
["zone7_c3_begin7"]="The girl has lost her mind, obviously, it's Titan's work. We can hold her here, but she'll remain like that for as long as Titan holds grip of her mind.",
["zone7_c3_begin8"]="So it's back to plan A: we're going to the Citadel with Shadow disguised as Titan's soldier.",
["zone7_c3_spaceship1"]="Folkss! I can ssmell it! Shadow Energy! Sso pure, sso undiluted! So tasssty!",
["zone7_c3_spaceship2"]="So... hungry! I smell it... on you! Damn you, Titan! What... have you done... to me!",
["zone7_c3_spaceship3"]="Scavengers. Titan runs horrible experiments on his prisoners, drives them mad with pain, then throws them away from the Citadel when he no longer needs them.",
["zone7_c3_spaceship4"]="Shadow Energy is like both food and dope for them. Strange. The Scavengers are usually scared of Titan's soldiers, but now they seem to...",
["zone7_c3_challenge_phrase1"]="Give 'im to me! Now! Now!",
["zone7_c3_challenge_phrase2"]="Ssee, folkss! Shadow man! He smellss so delicious! Let’ss feasst!",
["zone7_c3_spaceship_done1"]="Kali to Cypher. The Scavengers attacked us. They were babbling about a source of \"pure Shadow Energy\". Do you know of it?",
["zone7_c3_spaceship_done2"]="I understand Titan's true motives now. When you opened the Gates, Shadow Energy formed a new body for you. A capsule made of pure energy.",
["zone7_c3_spaceship_done3"]="Should you lose this battle, Titan won't need the champions' energy - he'll have yours. Any world finding itself in his way will be reduced to ashes.",
["zone7_c3_spaceship_done4"]="No! Fear is a luxury we can't afford. As long as you keep May under guard, Titan will not recognize Shadow. We're entering the Citadel now!",
["zone7_c3_citadel1"]="Why of course. Did you think you could trick my beasts? They know pure Shadow Energy - you can't hide! Welcome to my humble Citadel, Shadow.",
["zone7_c3_citadel2"]="You are my crowning glory! The Gates opened, and you survived the most powerful Shadow Energy emission. But you're no slave; you've retained your mind and will.",
["zone7_c3_citadel3"]="So many experiments, so many worlds... Finally, success! But before I take your power, meet some of those who, too, survived the Gates.",
["zone7_c3_citadel4"]="They were so much like you - your doubles, I might say - but lacked the will to hold so much energy...",
["zone7_c3_guard1_greetings1"]="Yours is the fame of the most talented assassin. For that is your main skill: killing. Why waste time with common rabble, doing their meaningless errands?",
["zone7_c3_guard1_greetings2"]="I took over the Order in one of the worlds, then did away with the bothersome old man and that skirt. Now only I decide who lives and who dies - I'm in control.",
["zone7_c3_guard1_defeated"]="You let me live... That mistake will cost you dearly! One day...",
["zone7_c3_guard2_greetings1"]="Mastery of combat is above all else. I have no match, so I choose to challenge the Eternity, so that I could excel myself.",
["zone7_c3_guard2_greetings2"]="I have become the greatest Master of the Orient. The rare disciple who earns an audience with me only reminds me of my superiority.",
["zone7_c3_guard2_defeated"]="You, wayward moron! I have founded a great school, and my name will be remembered, and pronounced gushingly! And you shall simply be forgotten...",
["zone7_c3_guard3_greetings1"]="You don't fear me? Strange. Should you had been a little braver, Shadow, you could've become me. Didn't you see people were worshiping you? Was it not obvious?",
["zone7_c3_guard3_greetings2"]="Butcher's children saw in me their messiah, one to free them from censure and morals. They are my flock now, and I lead them. Where we walk, blood will flow.",
["zone7_c3_guard3_defeated"]="Think well, Shadow. With your potential, you could lead nations! We can be at head of a great family of faithful! I shall be waiting.",
["zone7_c3_guard4_greetings1"]="Answering the call of the ocean granted me freedom! Now, the only true law is my law. And any who stand in my way - I'll feed them to the sea devil!",
["zone7_c3_guard4_greetings2"]="Wasp was weak! Now her fleet is mine. When the land rats see my black banner heaving, they know death is coming to their towns, death with my face!",
["zone7_c3_guard4_defeated"]="The ocean does not excuse mistakes. I shall now have to atone for my failure - atone with blood of innocents. Is that the victory you wanted?",
["zone7_c3_guard5_greetings1"]="Kneel, peasant, and behold your sovereign, who rules with an iron hand! When Shogun's head touched the ground, I took his kingdom - it was mine by rights!",
["zone7_c3_guard5_greetings2"]="You're meek, Shadow. People left to their own will shall soon destroy the State. And you are the quintessence of everything that I hate about commoners! ",
["zone7_c3_guard5_defeated"]="Cur, mongrel! Should you ever dare to trespass my kingdom, my vassals will flay you alive!",
["zone7_c3_allguardsdefeated1"]="Incredible! Your power is unprecedented! I never imagined you'd be able to defeat your dark half. But you have surpassed my expectations!",
["zone7_c3_allguardsdefeated2"]="Your essence belongs to me, just like the Gates that you have opened! It will open the way for me to thousands of worlds that have no heroes to guard them.",
["zone7_c3_allguardsdefeated3"]="Following the call of your heart brought you into my trap. Losing your body, you gained the ability to walk between the worlds. And that shall soon be mine.",
["zone7_c3_allguardsdefeated4"]="You're filled with fury, waiting to fight me, but... Once more, for the last time, I would like to watch what pure Shadow Energy is really capable of... May!",
["zone7_c3_allguardsdefeated5"]="I hear you, my lord.",
["zone7_c3_allguardsdefeated6"]="What?! How did she escape?",
["zone7_c3_allguardsdefeated7"]="Ha! Did you think that some ragtag gang could hold me in place? Their blood is on your hands!",
["zone7_c3_allguardsdefeated8"]="Skank!",
["zone7_c3_allguardsdefeated9"]="Restrain yourself, girlie. I've brought your buddy Cypher here to watch you fail. And you, Shadow, get a special reward for your obstinacy: fighting me!",
["zone7_c3_may_greetings"]="I know every move before you make it! I have seen all your fights! How can you hope to defeat me?",
["zone7_c3_may_defeated1"]="No... No! What's going on? Where am I? How did I get here?",
["zone7_c3_may_defeated2"]="It's okay. Just breathe. Titan kidnapped you, but Shadow gave chase. Now pull yourself together. We'll have time to discuss all that happened...",
["zone7_c3_may_defeated3"]="What... what have I done?",
["zone7_c3_may_defeated4"]="Our enemy proved to be more devious than expected. It was not your fault. But you should go now, while you can! Back through the Gates and to your world.",
["zone7_c3_may_defeated5"]="But... how can I leave... him?",
["zone7_c3_may_defeated6"]="That was the purpose of Shadow's mission: to set you free. Just go! The rest of us - we have things to do here. It's your turn, Shadow!",
["zone7_c3_may_defeated7"]="Your world teeters on the edge of the abyss, Shadow, unaware that its fate was already decided: it's destined to become the flesh and blood of the new empire!",
["zone7_c3_may_defeated8"]="After you fall, I will give you some time to see the finale of that world and the birth of the new one. Sheer, wild, endless. My world!",
["zone7_c3_losstoboss1"]="Do not wonder, Shadow. You, humans, live in haste, but I know the value of time. ",
["zone7_c3_losstoboss2"]="Thy friends and thy foes, they cannot see or hear us now. I have stopped the flow time so thou can take a breath. I give thee another chance.",
["zone7_c3_tournament_begins"]="New banners are now flying over the risen army! Ancient gave us new life, so that we should fight anyone who dares trespass in his realm.",
["zone7_c3_tournament_after6wins1"]="Once we came here to take Ancient’s head, but fell to his sword. He is now gone to the war of his own. He is not here anymore.",
["zone7_c3_tournament_after6wins2"]="So - Ancient has left the Stone Grove? Where did he go, I wonder?",
["zone7_c3_tournament_after12wins"]="There is more of us than you think. We shall rise from our tombs, again and again.",
["zone7_c3_tournament_after18wins"]="Titan was our lord, but it was Ancient who gave us new life. We shall protect the secrets of the Stone Grove forever!",
