["preCrowPredict"]="I prophesy thus:",
["hintMorgana"]="Required to enter the battle with Morgana",
["dlgWitch1Halloween19_Story1"]="Is this your dungeon? What a mess! The web of time is so thin that it makes me want to cry just looking at it.",
["dlgSenseiHalloween19_Story1"]="The web of time? Don’t touch that, it’s dangerous! In fact, just leave — the denizens of this dungeon want nothing to do with you.",
["dlgWitch1Halloween19_Story2"]="Nonsense! What could be more dangerous than a time-hole? My eight-legged weavers will take care of everything, and in the meantime that ominous raven can crow everyone’s fate!",
["dlgArkhosHalloween19_Story1"]="What is this? My mind is clouded... I have forgotten the sermon I spent a year preparing! And may that wretched raven be struck dumb for eternity!",
["dlgHoaxenHalloween19_Story1"]="I felt so old today! But my brother is wailing like a baby. This is madness — we are immortal, after all!",
["dlgFatumHalloween19_Story1"]="I see no more fate lines. The future tangles before my eyes... Chaos! Creator, have you cursed me?",
["dlgSenseiHalloween19_Story2"]="I’ll say it again: leave, and never come back! Any minute now they’ll realize this is all your fault! And when that happens, no amount of spiders or raven familiars will save you!",
["dlgWitch1Halloween19_Story3"]="Perhaps they will, perhaps they won’t... For those without clairvoyance are blind and helpless. I hold the threads of time in my hands, and I have aces up my sleeve!",
["dlgSenseiHalloween19_Story3"]="Shadow, that witch and her spiders think they can just walk in and take over. She’ll tangle time up so badly you won’t be able to find the ends! Only you can stop her.",
["dlgWitch1Halloween19_Story4"]="Pitiful old man! I could snap the thread of your life with a flick of my wrist. But come try me, and bring your apprentice too. Let’s see what they can do in battle.",
["dlgWitch1Halloween19_F1_Lose1"]="That was fun! But too easy. I’ll turn back the threads of time and give you another chance. Don’t disappoint me this time!",
["dlgWitch1Halloween19_F1_Win1"]="Your skill with weapons and dark magic is commendable, but remember what you’re fighting here. Time is a hydra. Cut off one head, and three more take its place.",
["dlgAssistantHalloween19_F1_Win1"]="She just... turned to dust? I don’t believe what I’m seeing! Her spiders are still here, and I think there are more of them. Is this another trick?",
["dlgAssistantHalloween19_F1_Win2"]="I swear that raven’s crowing is getting louder and more deranged.",
["dlgWitch1Halloween19_F1_Win2"]="Did you think things would be so simple? You may have won once, but a new day draws near, and another one after that. I can feel fresh power flowing through me. Can you?",
["dlgWitch2Halloween19_F1_Win1"]="I already know the outcome of our battle, Shadow. I have experienced it countless times, and in each I emerged victorious. But I do still enjoy reliving this moment.",
["dlgWitch3Halloween19_F1_Win1"]="Have you met Death? My pet and I have become quite close with her. She’ll drop by anytime I call.",
["dlgAssistantHalloween19_F1_Win3"]="Wonderful! Now there are three of them! Just what I needed. Three witch sisters and their pets... or is that the same raven?",
["dlgSenseiHalloween19_F1_Win1"]="There’s no way out of this. The spiders will just keep tangling the threads of time — we have no choice but to take them all down. Hopefully not all at once.",
["dlgWitch1Halloween19_F1_Win3"]="Fight me first, Shadow! My sisters love to give dramatic speeches. It’s incredibly boring. But I promise to skip the sermons.",
["dlgWitch1Halloween19_F2_Lose1"]="Is that all you’ve got? You’re not even worth killing. Get up. I’ll turn back time, and we’ll try again!",
["dlgWitch1Halloween19_F2_Win1"]="I can feel it. I’m on the verge of dissolving into a vortex of time... But today’s battle was worth it!",
["dlgWitch1Halloween19_F2_Win2"]="Shadow, I said no long-winded speeches, so I’ll keep it short: Run. The outcome of your battle with my sisters has already been determined. Mortals stand no chance against time!",
["dlgAssistantHalloween19_F2_Win1"]="She disappeared! And I don’t think she’ll be back. Looks like that just made the other two madder. There’s enough raven wings here to block out the sun.",
["dlgWitch2Halloween19_F2_Win1"]="Too afraid to take me on first? The web of time faltered when my sister disappeared. But it didn’t tear. I will avenge her!",
["dlgWitch2Halloween19_F3_Lose1"]="You think I’d let you die when I could keep you experiencing this moment eternally? Get up. I want to defeat you again and again!",
["dlgWitch2Halloween19_F3_Win1"]="Where are my spiders? The threads are slipping from my grasp... That was not foretold, it should not be. Not yesterday, not today, not ever!",
["dlgSenseiHalloween19_F3_Win1"]="She isn’t coming back. Then predictions don’t always come true? Even if you were in the future and saw it all with your own eyes? That means we have a chance!",
["dlgWitch3Halloween19_F3_Win1"]="Are you trying to comprehend time, old man? You can only accomplish that by looking Death in the eye. Come here. I’ll introduce you!",
["dlgWitch3Halloween19_F4_Lose1"]="Death and I have an agreement, remember? I can avenge my sisters for time eternal.",
["dlgWitch3Halloween19_F4_Lose2"]="You haven’t earned respite. You’ll fight me until an empty husk is all that’s left of you!",
["dlgWitch3Halloween19_F4_Win1"]="Death deceived me! So it was all a game... I cannot weave the threads of time anymore. Or even tear them. At least now I’ll know peace.",
["dlgAssistantHalloween19_F4_Win1"]="Is it over? Everything seems so much brighter and quieter. The spiders are scurrying away. I think we won, Shadow!",
["dlgSenseiHalloween19_F4_Win1"]="I would say we learned a valuable lesson, but the best I can come up with is “Just try not to die.” And what kind of sensei would I be if I gave out wisdom like that?",
["RavenPhrase_1"]="Caw!",
["RavenPhrase_2"]="Caw-cawww!",
["RavenPhrase_3"]="Caaaw-caaaw!",
