["PredictionFortuneCookie"]="Prediction!",
["dlgNY20AnnounceFreeze_1"]="The land is covered with a dusting of light snow, and the scent of warm milk and cinnamon fills the air. The time of miracles and gifts is almost here!",
["dlgNY20AnnounceSensei_1"]="You again, Freeze? Don't you remember that it didn't end well for you the last time we met?",
["dlgNY20AnnounceFreeze_2"]="Ha! True, I was angry at the world and caused you a lot of trouble! But I have changed! Now the holiday spirit is in safe hands.",
["dlgNY20AnnounceAssistant_1"]="Do you really think we'll take you at your word?",
["dlgNY20AnnounceFreeze_3"]="Well... I rose through the ranks to become Santa's deputy and infallible helper. He taught me to create magical presents. There are heaps of them this year!",
["dlgNY20AnnounceAssistant_2"]="Sounds good... All right, I'm glad that the holidays will be peaceful this year at least.",
["dlgNY20AnnounceFreeze_4"]="I don't want to disappoint you, but looks like things aren't as rosy as they seem: my boss went away on business and disappeared entirely. No one has heard from him in weeks!",
["dlgNY20AnnounceFreeze_5"]="I sent my best scouts to search for him, but they disappeared too! I'm sure that the mighty warrior Shadow will help me save the festivities!",
["dlgNY20AnnounceSensei_2"]="What could have happened? Do you think people might have stopped believing in miracles, and so Santa just left?",
["dlgNY20AnnounceFreeze_6"]="I'm afraid the truth behind it is much more frightening...",
["dlgNY20AnnounceAssistant_3"]="Ha! More frightening than defeating the Immortals with your bare hands?",
["dlgNY20AnnounceFreeze_7"]="We need to follow Santa's trail. It will be a long and difficult road, so I want to be sure I made the right choice. Shadow will face me in a tournament!",
["dlgNY20AnnounceFreeze_8"]="Prove your worth in a fair fight. If you win, you'll get the finest magical equipment straight from my workshop!",
["dlgNY20Freeze_Loose"]="Pick yourself up, Shadow! You're not good enough for this mission! I'm sure your enemies would flee in terror if you had more shadow blasts and elixirs.",
["dlgNY20Sensei_Loose"]="He's right, Shadow! Good equipment brings the promise of victory! Let's visit the store!",
["dlgNY20Freeze_Win"]="Keep it up, Shadow! It was a glorious fight, but the future is uncertain. You need to train more! Let's fight again!",
["dlgNY20Sensei_Win"]="If the Christmas spirit is so serious, then trouble must be on the way... Shadow, we need to keep training!",
["dlgNY20Final_Scout1"]="Boss... I barely made it... We were ambushed... no one was expecting it... all our men are dead! The threat was too much for us to handle!",
["dlgNY20Final_Freeze1"]="This is one of my faithful scouts! You made it back after all! What did you find? Did you see any signs of Santa?!",
["dlgNY20Final_Scout2"]="Nothing but black sand! So many hands... grasping at my face! Must... not... fall... asleep...",
["dlgNY20Final_Sensei"]="Looks like he's badly injured and delirious. He needs to rest. We, in the meantime, should prepare to face whatever it is that awaits us!",
["descPredictionFortuneCookie"]="Find out what awaits you in the future!",
