["FreezePredictBeginning13"]="Celebrate with all your might.",
["FreezePredictBeginning14"]="Fairy sparks gather over you:",
["FreezePredictBeginning15"]="If you're trying to build your own world,",
["FreezePredictBeginning16"]="If you are sitting in silence right now,",
["FreezePredictBeginning17"]="Look around especially carefully:",
["FreezePredictBeginning18"]="Laugh at the serious.",
["FreezePredictBeginning19"]="Invent a puzzle from what is at hand:",
["FreezePredictBeginning20"]="Rush into events like a whirlwind.",
["FreezePredictBeginning21"]="When the wind of change blows your hat off,",
["FreezePredictBeginning22"]="When the past is dragged into the quagmire, take action:",
["FreezePredictBeginning23"]="Do not sit waiting for a sign, and do not be afraid.",
["FreezePredictBeginning24"]="If you decide to feel sorry for yourself and hide, remember:",
["FreezePredictBeginning25"]="When the compass needle is spinning,",
["FreezePredictBeginning26"]="If the search for yourself is dragging on,",
["FreezePredictBeginning27"]="If everything has become gray and negative,",
["FreezePredictBeginning28"]="When the environment has lost all color,",
["FreezePredictBeginning29"]="On the coldest and darkest day,",
["FreezePredictBeginning30"]="Smile at your failure.",
["FreezePredictBeginning31"]="Turn your weaknesses into strength.",
["FreezePredictBeginning32"]="End things on a positive note.",
["FreezePredictEnding1"]="be ready for changes!",
["FreezePredictEnding2"]="the ice is creeping up on you!",
["FreezePredictEnding3"]="prepare some surprises - before it's too late!",
["FreezePredictEnding4"]="stick to the plan, but don't forget to enjoy and have fun!",
["FreezePredictEnding5"]="get yourself together and drag yourself to your goal as quickly as possible!",
["FreezePredictEnding6"]="some things will take a while to clear up!",
["FreezePredictEnding7"]="look for strange coincidences in ordinary happenings!",
["FreezePredictEnding8"]="talk about what you usually hide!",
["FreezePredictEnding9"]="you can look at things differently!",
["FreezePredictEnding10"]="make something grandiose out of small pieces!",
["FreezePredictEnding11"]="connect similar entities and people!",
["FreezePredictEnding12"]="know that there is no inevitability!",
["FreezePredictEnding13"]="there is no limit to your potential!",
["FreezePredictEnding14"]="believe that very soon, everything will be brighter than before!",
["FreezePredictEnding15"]="call upon all that you can!",
["FreezePredictEnding16"]="study everything as if it were a miracle!",
["FreezePredictEnding17"]="create what you dream up, no matter what!",
["FreezePredictEnding18"]="put the mirror where you need it most!",
["FreezePredictEnding19"]="look for opportunities - they are waiting in the wings!",
["FreezePredictEnding20"]="clear space for unexpected thoughts!",
["FreezePredictEnding21"]="set your sails and fly to victory!",
["FreezePredictEnding22"]="happiness is in your hands, fortune favors the brave!",
["FreezePredictEnding23"]="doubt is the enemy of development and progress!",
["FreezePredictEnding24"]="only the desperate and the bravest can conquer peaks!",
["FreezePredictEnding25"]="let your heart and dreams guide you!",
["FreezePredictEnding26"]="listen to your inner voice and laugh!",
["FreezePredictEnding27"]="embrace your muse and smile at her!",
["FreezePredictEnding28"]="align your path to the brightest stars!",
["FreezePredictEnding29"]="remember the warmth of the summer sun and the fresh breeze!",
["FreezePredictEnding30"]="don't forget you're better and smarter than you were before! Luck be upon you!",
["FreezePredictEnding31"]="and success will not keep you waiting! Just believe!",
["FreezePredictEnding32"]="only by getting rid of the old can you find the new!",
