["CNY20AnnounceTitle"]="Lunar New Year!",
["EventAnnounceStart"]="The sparkling celebration is already here! A gift, unique items and sales!",
["CNY20Announce2"]="Win ancient tokens {0} in the holiday raid and use them to buy a chest and elixirs! Placing higher in raid means more ancient tokens!",
["EventAnnounceGift_2"]="A gift in honor of the Lunar New Year update! Onward to victory in raids!",
["ProgressBarCNY"]="Collect ancient tokens in raids and buy the chest!",
["ProgressBarCNYFull"]="You've collected enough ancient tokens! Press the button to buy the chest!",
["dlgCNY20AnnounceBoss_1"]="I descended from the clouds with the falling spark of a firework to celebrate the Lunar New Year and enjoy the festivities. And I brought gifts!",
["dlgCNY20AnnounceAssistant_1"]="Our celebration must be truly amazing, and there must be genuine treasures in that gift box, since the messenger of the Eternal Blue Sky himself visited us!",
["dlgCNY20AnnounceSensei_1"]="I've never seen a livelier holiday in all my long life! And what an unique and beautiful crate! Don`t make us wait too long!",
["dlgCNY20AnnounceBoss_2"]="Patience, old man, I`ve heard you have here a great invincible warrior who went through the Gates of Shadows and crushes the very forces of nature!",
["dlgCNY20AnnounceBoss_3"]="I want to challenge him - it's been a long time since I've stretched my fighting muscles. Without a worthy opponent, I will certainly lose my skills!",
["dlgCNY20AnnounceAssistant_2"]="Hmm, Shadow should have no trouble showing you who's top panda around here, but what do you offer in return?",
["dlgCNY20AnnounceBoss_4"]="Ha! I`ll toss a coin to your fighter afterwards - those ancient tokens always bring good luck and plenty. So, do we have a deal or what? Shall we begin?",
["dlgCNY20Boss_Loose"]="Oof, it was a glorious battle and the reward is yours, as I promised. But I will not leave without a rematch. Let`s fight!",
["dlgCNY20Assistant_Loose"]="I enjoyed it too! Shadow, let's do it again!",
["dlgCNY20Boss_Win"]="Ha, is it always so much fun around here? I didn't even break a sweat! As long as the celebration continues, you know where to find me. Come prepared next time!",
["EventBoss_Lose"]="Shadow, pull yourself together, remember what I`ve taught you!",
