["preWhisperPredict"]="Behold your fate:",
["preFatumPredict"]="I prophesy thus:",
["HW20Fatum1"]="The bounds between worlds grow thin, meaning this is the best night for predictions! The air is filled with magic, and my hands hold the threads of fate itself!",
["HW20Megalith1"]="You said the events included fortunetelling and a masquerade, so I brought a magic mirror. And for the first time in a millennium, I can see my reflection. This mask makes me look old!",
["HW20Fatum2"]="For me, fortunetelling is a game – I can do with the fates of mortals whatever I wish. But you are a different affair altogether, my friends. Please, have a seat!",
["HW20Arkhos1"]="I can see without foresight that the fire of faith shall burn both the weak and the blind. I have brought black candles to allow all to see this as clearly as I do!",
["HW20Fatum3"]="You have been blinded by your hatred. Let us begin. Speak not, but listen. I see a figure… black as night… feathers and ashes… take me by the hand…",
["HW20Whisper1"]="Have you been playing around with prophecy, little sister? Take charge of the destinies of the mortals, for all others have always been mine!",
["HW20Fatum4"]="How… how did you end up here? The path to this world was closed to you!",
["HW20Whisper2"]="It was! But you called, and I came, through this miraculous mirror. I am taking it with me. Be sure to come visit and hear some real fortunes told!",
["dlgWhisperGreetings"]="Looks like someone can’t wait to discover their fate. Give me your hand and gaze into the mirror!",
["dlgWhisperWin"]="I will take you with me into the realm of ash, spirit, and eternal night! Trust me, look into my eyes, and do not look away.",
["dlgWhisperLost"]="You are still alive? Then you are not in my power! Fatum shall predict your destiny, and then I shall return to my world. After warning you to tread carefully with mirrors!",
