["ChestNY21_FirstPurchase"]="With the first purchase of a Gingerbread Chest you receive a gift!",
["NY21Candy1"]="Hey, are you heading into the underworld? Help me give out some sweets! And while you’re at it, treat yourself to my gingerbread castle with its marzipan towers and fortified candy walls!",
["NY21Sly1"]="Wait, don’t eat that! All the candy is poisoned, the toys give you frostbite, and the Christmas ornaments shatter into shards in your hands.",
["NY21Candy2"]="How dare you say that about my masterpieces? Now you shall endure my curse. Blizzard of sugar, blind this one!",
["NY21Sly2"]="Damn, I can’t see a thing. And it’s freezing!",
["NY21Sly3"]="She’s gone mad! Every winter she brought us candy, the best in the world. She was kind. She was friendly. And now she’s gone nuts!",
["NY21Sly4"]="Here, take these potions. They’re supposed to help in combat. Get yourself equipped and get moving!",
["NY21Candy3"]="You’ve come to help, eh? I don’t need you! They all laughed at me. Called me a sugar witch. Said that instead of spells I wielded marshmallows and licorice!",
["NY21Candy4"]="I’ll show them! Now my licorice can crush my enemies like a boa constrictor and my marshmallow clouds can shower them with razor-sharp hard candies!",
["NY21Megalith1"]="Absurd! No one has ever made fun of her. I always liked what she made, the yummy fruit jellies especially!",
["NY21Arkhos1"]="I... I only joked a couple of times. How could I have known she was so touchy?",
["NY21Hoaxen1"]="I always ordered two pastries and remarked how she was the sweetest of all.",
["NY21Candy5"]="Shut up! You all hated me, and I know it. Now you will suffer!",
["NY21CandyWin"]="Like a sheet of whipped cream blocking my sight... What was that? What a mess... And the gingerbread house has been smashed! I’d better rebuild it.",
["dlgNY20Candy_Win"]="Sorry for the troubles i've caused. As my apologies, I will tell you what lies ahead in your future.",
["NY21SlyWin"]="Look, she’s coming to, and I’ve thawed out. You did it! Now the holidays are safe!",
["NY21CandyLoss"]="Chains of gumdrops, shackles of chocolate, hold him tight! The others, I’ll deal with myself.",
["RAIDBOSS_Candy"]="CANDY",
["RAIDBOSS_CANDY_TITLE"]="Candy",
["hintCandy"]="Required to enter the battle with Candy",
["dlgNY21Candy_Win"]="Sorry for the problems i have caused. As an apology, I will give you a hint of your future that lies ahead.",
["dlgNY21Candy_Loose"]="Pick yourself up, Shadow! You're not good enough for this mission! I'm sure your enemies would flee in terror if you had more shadow blasts and elixirs.",
["NY21BigGift"]="Best wishes from the Shadow Fight 2 development team! Merry Christmas and Happy New Year 2021! Thank so much you for being with us, you are the best!",
["CandyPredictBeginning_1"]="Life will bring many surprises,",
["CandyPredictBeginning_2"]="Understanding will come suddenly,",
["CandyPredictBeginning_3"]="The atmosphere will become friendly,",
["CandyPredictBeginning_4"]="Your holiday fire will burn so bright,",
["CandyPredictBeginning_5"]="The holidays will give you new energy, new ideas,",
["CandyPredictBeginning_6"]="What is complicated will become clear,",
["CandyPredictBeginning_7"]="Achieving success is not impossible,",
["CandyPredictBeginning_8"]="Holiday wishes can lead to important ruminations,",
["CandyPredictBeginning_9"]="Journeys and destinations you’ll find aplenty,",
["CandyPredictBeginning_10"]="A chance meeting might just change everything,",
["CandyPredictBeginning_11"]="Your friends will keep old promises,",
["CandyPredictBeginning_12"]="The holidays will bring a long-forgotten feel of delight,",
["CandyPredictBeginning_13"]="A wish you think too wild to make will come true,",
["CandyPredictBeginning_14"]="The magic of the holidays will encircle you with warmth,",
["CandyPredictBeginning_15"]="Take notes, and later they will come in handy,",
["CandyPredictBeginning_16"]="The desire to shoot off fireworks will creep up on you,",
["CandyPredictBeginning_17"]="You’ll find yourself needing some bagpipes and a crazy costume,",
["CandyPredictBeginning_18"]="Your holiday night will be unforgettable,",
["CandyPredictBeginning_19"]="Prophesies shall find fulfillment,",
["CandyPredictBeginning_20"]="The holiday revelry will hold secret meaning,",
["CandyPredictBeginning_21"]="Paper snowflakes will mean something special,",
["CandyPredictBeginning_22"]="Your memories will draw you into a whole different world,",
["CandyPredictBeginning_23"]="What seemed an obstacle will prove a bridge,",
["CandyPredictBeginning_24"]="Life’s events will dance in time with your mood,",
["CandyPredictBeginning_25"]="A fairy tale will come near to you,",
["CandyPredictBeginning_26"]="Something you’ve turned in your mind will suddenly open,",
["CandyPredictBeginning_27"]="What once robbed you of peace will now be your ally,",
["CandyPredictBeginning_28"]="Your holiday dreams will show you the way,",
["CandyPredictBeginning_29"]="Your thoughts will be more joyous than ever,",
["CandyPredictBeginning_30"]="Magical moments lie in wait close by,",
["CandyPredictBeginning_31"]="All will change for the better,",
["CandyPredictBeginning_32"]="Life will become both beautiful and bright,",
["CandyPredictBeginning_33"]="Each day will be better than the one before,",
["CandyPredictBeginning_34"]="The wonders of the future will come to inspire you,",
["CandyPredictEnding_1"]="when you postpone your busy work and gather around the hearth with all those dear to you.",
["CandyPredictEnding_2"]="if you determine how to properly direct your enthusiasm.",
["CandyPredictEnding_3"]="when you remember old hobbies and take them up once more.",
["CandyPredictEnding_4"]="if only you put up some holiday lights in the windows.",
["CandyPredictEnding_5"]="just stay on course and remember to enjoy life!",
["CandyPredictEnding_6"]="and you must always remember what it is that inspires you.",
["CandyPredictEnding_7"]="and you must not be afraid of change.",
["CandyPredictEnding_8"]="so be observant and curious, noticing every detail around you.",
["CandyPredictEnding_9"]="so trim up the Christmas tree and make some big plans!",
["CandyPredictEnding_10"]="so just remember that you have the strength to reach as high as you want!",
["CandyPredictEnding_11"]="so allow yourself to seek adventure – and enjoy it!",
["CandyPredictEnding_12"]="if you look at yourself with new eyes.",
["CandyPredictEnding_13"]="but for now, make some hot chocolate and share it with someone.",
["CandyPredictEnding_14"]="if you learn to enjoy the beauty of your surroundings.",
["CandyPredictEnding_15"]="so do not give up when everything around vanishes into shrouds of snow.",
["CandyPredictEnding_16"]="if you learn to protect what you hold dear.",
["CandyPredictEnding_17"]="so be careful not to miss the right moment.",
["CandyPredictEnding_18"]="so do not wait for the right moment – just do what you need to do.",
["CandyPredictEnding_19"]="even if everything seems pointless and life grows weary.",
["CandyPredictEnding_20"]="when you remember the games you played as a child.",
["CandyPredictEnding_21"]="when the time comes to receive your gift of fate.",
["CandyPredictEnding_22"]="but for now, settle all the little things you’ve been postponing for so long.",
["CandyPredictEnding_23"]="if you look in the mirror and find a spark in your eye.",
["CandyPredictEnding_24"]="if you are aware of your most cherished desire.",
["CandyPredictEnding_25"]="when you grab the Christmas ornaments from the farthest shelf.",
["CandyPredictEnding_26"]="but first, be ready for any surprise!",
["CandyPredictEnding_27"]="but first remember everyone who taught you to be a better person!",
["CandyPredictEnding_28"]="as long as you ask everyone what you can do to help them have a great time.",
["CandyPredictEnding_29"]="but don’t forget to protect the best things in life and eliminate the rest, without regrets.",
["CandyPredictEnding_30"]="but for now, make some ornaments and enjoy yourself!",
["CandyPredictEnding_31"]="as long as you invite only your most faithful friends to your table.",
["CandyPredictEnding_32"]="when you find happiness and harmony within!",
["CandyPredictEnding_33"]="when you find inner strength and confidence!",
