["IE21AnnounceTitle"]="Rama Navami!",
["IndianChest_FirstPurchase"]="Get a gift with your first Casket of Elephant's King purchase!",
["IE21Announce1"]="Earn eastern coins {0} in event raid and exchange them on the casket or potions! Higher place in raid - more event coins.",
["dlgIE21AnnounceSensei_1"]="Shadow, I feel a mysterious threat is coming. Something evil made its way into our world again.",
["dlgIE21AnnounceBoss_1"]="You, pathetic mortals, bow down before my will and glory or i'll force you to do that!",
["dlgIE21AnnounceAssistant_1"]="Who on earth is that? What are you doing in our world and why should we even listen to you?",
["dlgIE21AnnounceBoss_2"]="How dare you to talk like that with me, Ravana, the conquer of all three worlds!",
["dlgIE21AnnounceBoss_3"]="This is your last chance to kneel or I will cut your head off!",
["dlgIE21AnnounceAssistant_2"]="Pff! No idea where did you come from, but you wouldn't stay here for too long!",
["dlgIE21AnnounceAssistant_3"]="Hey, Shadow, this bully has gone too far! Let's teach him some manners!",
["dlgIE21Boss_After_Loose"]="If all the people of this world are that weak, then the conquest of this world is just a matter of time!",
["dlgIE21Boss_Sensei_Loose"]="Don't let him go, he's too dangerous!",
["dlgIE21Boss_After_Win"]="FOOLS!!! I retreat for now, but you won't defeat me so easily. I will come back!",
["dlgIE21Boss_Assistant_Win"]="Come back as long as you like, but you won't get past us!",
["dlgKeyAnnounceTitle"]="LOTUS KEY",
["txtRavanaHardTip"]="In this raid battle, you can't jump. Try to attack the enemy when he jumps to interrupt his ability",
["dlgDeviceBlock"]="Unfortunately, this device is not supported.",
["dlgRaidFastBuy"]="Do not ask for such confirmation again.",
