["RANGED_AE21_TOMAHAWK"]="Сhieftain's Tomahawk",
["ARMOR_AE21_WARRIOR"]="Robe of Courage",
["HELM_AE21_ROACH"]="Sachem's  Roach",
["MAGIC_AE21_SPIRIT_PILLAR"]="Spirits' Wrath",
["AmericanChest"]="Casket of Ancestors",
["AmericanChestDesc"]="Contains event equipment for Independence day and raid consumables.",
["Pile_KeyAE21"]="Bundle of Valley's Feather",
["Pile_KeyAE21Dsc"]="{0} keys to enter the battle with Adanti",
["AE21AnnounceTitle"]="Independence Day!",
["AmericanChest_FirstPurchase"]="Get a gift with your first Casket of Ancestors purchase!",
["EventAnnounceCoin"]="Earn coins {0} in event raid and exchange them on the casket or potions! Higher place in a raid - more event coins.",
["dlgAE21AnnounceBoss_1"]="For many moons, I've been in the beast form. I've forgotten how does it feel to be a human, yet I've got real freedom.",
["dlgAE21AnnounceSensei_1"]="The curse made you crazy, shaman! It is hard to be human, but you chose the easy way.",
["dlgAE21AnnounceBoss_2"]="You all just humans. Fragile, full of doubts. What is insanity for you, for me - a gift of strength! You won't dare to reject my mercy!",
["dlgAE21AnnounceAssistant_1"]="What kind of freedom is it when you deprive us of the right to choose...",
["dlgAE21AnnounceBoss_3"]="I sense the fear. It boils my blood! You will accept my blessing and then understand everything...But if you won't, I will feast upon your vitality!",
["dlgAE21AnnounceSensei_2"]="Shadow, you must teach the beast a lesson that it won't forget: the strength of the human spirit is immortal!",
["dlgAE21Boss_After_Loose"]="Is that your vaunted spirit? Must taste bitter... I will gather a whole army while you are recovering!",
["dlgAE21Boss_Sensei_Loose"]="We are quite the same in some manner, Beast. We firmly hold for our life, for example. Stand up, Shadow!",
["dlgAE21Boss_After_Win"]="Your spirit is strong for sure, human... Why do I feel so weak, decrepit, and worthless?",
["dlgAE21Boss_Sensei_After_Win"]="Because you have a human's soul under the mask of the beast. Your curse is that you are neither one nor the other.",
["dlgAE21Boss_Assistant_After_Win"]="You can choose who you wanna be. That's what makes us \"human\".",
["dlgAE21OfferTitle"]="SACHEM'S ROACH",
["dlgAE21OfferDesc"]="The unique Sachem's Roach made for true leaders! Get an exclusive item for a fair price!Hurry and get it before the event ends!",
["dlgAE21OfferDescLastChance"]="The unique Sachem's Roach made for true leaders! This is the last chance to get an exclusive item for a fair price!  Hurry and catch up before the event ends!",
["dlgKeyAE21AnnounceTitle"]="Valley's Feather",
["dlgKeyAnnounce"]="Event key {0} can be acquired by fighting with other raid bosses, also you earn it in the mystery box, buy it in the shop, or receive it as a reward for daily quests.",
