["dlgRaidJuniorLottery"]="Fortune favors beginners. Take advantage of her generosity and try your luck in the lottery!",
["dlgForgeMaterialOffer"]="A unique opportunity to buy material for a favorable price!{br}Defeating an enemy using enchantment is way easier.",
