["dlgOffer_Receive"]="You've received:",
["dlgSurvivalRestartRewardedVideoTitle"]="Ressurection",
["dlgSurvivalRestartRewardedVideo"]="You can replay the current survival round with half health. Until the end of the offer {br}offer expires in: ",
["Summer21AnnounceTitle"]="Cold Revenge",
["BOSS_Freeze_Son_Title"]="Freeze Jr.",
["BOSS_Freeze_Son"]="FREEZE JR.",
["dlgSummer21AnnounceFreezeJun_1"]="Fire is fun! Why didn't I notice that before? Your world will burn to the ground! Frost just bites, but fire – it devours! You won't forget this summer!",
["dlgSummer21AnnounceSensei_1"]="Freeze, wait! Your young mind doesn't realize that fire will doom you as well! It doesn't know who is a friend and who is a foe!",
["dlgSummer21AnnounceFreezeJun_2"]="What did the power over the cold give me? Nothing but the shame that I brought to my race when I lost to you, people! But fire cleanses everything...",
["dlgSummer21AnnounceFreeze_1"]="One fail, and you're ready to set the world on fire? Is that how I raised you, son? Come back home. Revenge is a dish best served cold.",
["dlgSummer21AnnounceFreezeJun_3"]="What can you teach me, old man? You're going soft! Just in one summer, I've done more than you did in a hundred years! And I'm just getting warmed up.",
["dlgSummer21AnnounceSensei_2"]="Freeze won't be able to control his new abilities, Shadow. We must cool him down before he turns into a new Supernova!",
["dlgSummer21FreezeJun_Loose"]="If you stare at the sun, you go blind. But I want you to see your world turned into a burned-out cinder! Don't forget your sunscreen!",
["dlgSummer21Freeze_Loose"]="Come on, get up, hero! You must teach my flippant son an important lesson: a cool mind is stronger than a hot temper! I won't stand in your way.",
["dlgSummer21Boss_FreezeJun_Win"]="Even fire didn't help me to achieve victory... What am I doing wrong, father?",
["dlgSummer21Boss_Freeze_Win"]="There is no shame in losing to a worthy opponent, son. Our strength lies in cold calculation! I will teach you. Give an old man a chance.",
["dlgSummer21Boss_FreezeJun_Win_2"]="Forgive me, father. I won't betray our traditions ever again. I will learn. One day, the blizzard will sound like music. And you will hear my name in it...",
["dlgSummer21Sensei_Win"]="You were just as arrogant, Shadow. Do you remember how it ended last time? I hope the fight with Freeze will be a lesson for you too.",
["dlgSummer21OfferTitle"]="BEACH PUNISHER",
["dlgSummer21OfferDesc"]="A unique sword that can fight any heat! It will help you stop the disaster brought by Freeze Jr. Hurry and get this unique sword at a great price!",
["dlgSummer21OfferDescLastChance"]="The promotion is about to end! Your last opportunity to get this unique sword at a great price! You won't get the chance again!",
