["ARMOR_SUMMER21_LEGIONER"]="Coastal Sunset",
["dlgHW21StoryArkhos_1"]="The plague is coming to your town, mortals! Bow down before the mightiness of your god! And delight eyes with shine of gold, or else...",
["dlgHW21StorySensei_1"]="Since when do the gods of the underworld come up here and extort money from ordinary people? Throw off your mask, deceiver, before we take up arms!",
["dlgHW21StoryThief_1"]="Wait! It's me... Sly! Don't hit me! He promised that everyone would fear me... And no one would recognize me. How did I give myself away?",
["dlgHW21StoryMay_1"]="Whatever \"mask\" you put on, your greed will reveal you, Sly. What is this magic? Who gave you the power to change your appearance?",
["dlgHW21StoryThief_2"]="The owner of the wandering theater, Puppeteer. He said it would be his best performance. Gods among people! It meant nothing to me. But the money on the other hand...",
["dlgHW21StoryPuppeteer_1"]="What do you know about art! You ruined my greatest entreprise! Nevertheless... the third act is coming. And in it, the hero breathes his last!",
["dlgHW21StorySensei_2"]="Theater should inspire, not horrify. And you've distorted the essence of art. We will stop you before your \"actors\" get hurt.",
["dlgHW21LosePuppeteer_1"]="I wouldn't even trust you in a non-speaking role, Shadow. The stage is not where you belong, do not disgrace my craft!",
["dlgHW21LoseSensei_1"]="Shadow, you don't need a magic mask to acquire greatness! Get up and be the hero of your story!",
["dlgHW21WinPuppeteer_1"]="This is a fiasco! You ruined my wonderful plot and broke my masks! How can I stage a play now without props...",
["dlgHW21WinMay_1"]="Think about staging a comedy. For the sake of variety. It is harder to genuinely amuse people than it is to scare them.",
["dlgHW21WinSensei_1"]="We all wear masks. Every day we don a new one. Perhaps it's time for you to throw off yours, Puppeteer. Actors should come out to bow.",
["dlgHW21WinPuppeteer_2"]="Throw off my mask, you say... Well, my dear reasoner, you gave me an idea for my new plot. You are already invited to the premiere...",
