["dlgNY22StoryScout_1"]="Save me, hide me! I can still hear the creak of its branches next to my ears... I should never have set foot in that forest... that godforsaken place!",
["dlgNY22StorySensei_1"]="Take a deep breath, traveler. Then explain clearly: who's following you and what should we be afraid of?",
["dlgNY22StoryScout_2"]="They told me that place was guarded by a forest spirit, but I didn't believe them... He hates humans for entering his domain and defiling it with science.",
["dlgNY22StoryShurale_1"]="Mortals! Ha-a-and me my prey! Humans be food for roots. He-e-ear me, forest will be your grave. And world be green again!",
["dlgNY22StoryMay_1"]="With all respect, we too take care of our own. It's sad that the Shadow Energy human brought with him is killing you...",
["dlgNY22StoryShurale_2"]="Not help me, just talking, and I want to e-e-eat! Winter so lo-o-ong and the soil so de-e-ad.",
["dlgNY22StorySensei_2"]="I don't envy the fate of anyone who becomes mulch at the edge of the forest. Sorry, spirit, but this is where we draw the line. We'll answer force with force.",
["dlgNY22StoryShurale_Lose"]="Thin and bony. Not tas-s-sty for roots. Weak in spirit are poison for the fores-s-st... Grass not s-s-sprout in s-s-spring! Be gone!",
["dlgNY22StorySensei_Lose"]="Don't think of the spirit as the human enemy, Shadow. Nature only understands strength. Only the strongest survive, so get up!",
["dlgNY22StoryShurale_Win"]="S-s-strong human. I lose... Now winter never end... You don't see what you do, what is to come. You kill yourselves. Fools...",
["dlgNY22StoryMay_Win"]="Nature always finds a way. One day, none of us will be here, but you'll still be around...",
["dlgNY22StorySensei_Win"]="We need to live in symbiosis. Humans can't survive without you. Spirit of the forest, don't you know what \"harmony\" is? We'll help you. For our own sake.",
["dlgNY22StoryShurale_Win_2"]="Convincing. Good. I leave, but remember I everywhere. Today be a les-s-son for you. Next time I not so merc-c-ciful.",
