["dlgCHNY22OfferDesc"]="Master an element to your will and it will become a fearful weapon against your enemies! Purchase unique magic and get a kunai as a gift! Hurry before the event ends!",
["dlgCHNY22OfferDescLastChance"]="The promotion is about to end! Your last opportunity to get this unique magic at a great price! You won't get the chance again!",
