["dlgIndia22Story_Sitaram_1"]="Having heard your life story, may the gods reward you according to your merits! I come bearing bad news: An evil spirit has appeared in my lands...",
["dlgIndia22Story_Sensei_1"]="Tell me about him, traveler. From your clothes I can tell that you have journeyed from afar. What trouble besets your home?",
["dlgIndia22Story_Sitaram_2"]="This demon's evil is only matched by its hunger! We were preparing to celebrate Bohag Bihu, when suddenly this... creature appeared and ate all our seedlings!",
["dlgIndia22Story_May_1"]="And you began to starve... What could this demon have wanted at your happy celebration? How could simple farmers have attracted this predator?",
["dlgIndia22Story_Sitaram_3"]="As Agni is my witness, my lady, I ask myself the same question! Now we await the sunset in horror... Come with me, I beg you!",
["dlgIndia22Story_Rakshasa_1"]="You have an interesting smell, human. No doubt you taste good too! Can you hear how my belly rumbles? Some meat to go with my rice would be great!",
["dlgIndia22Story_Sensei_2"]="Curb your appetite, demon! There will be no invitation to the festival of life for one who can take others' lives away!",
["dlgIndia22Story_Rakshasa_Lose"]="Fortunately for you, our fight has worn me out. Besides, my hunger is satisfied... I'll work up an appetite and start to hunt again!",
["dlgIndia22Story_Sensei_Lose"]="A little more and there will nothing left of the settlement but dead earth! Get up, Shadow, or the holiday will be turned to ashes!",
["dlgIndia22Story_Rakshasa_Win"]="I answered your call because you promised me your neighbors' fields! I'm eternally hungry! It's in my nature. And you, you're envious and unappetizing.",
["dlgIndia22Story_May_Win"]="You brought this trouble on the people yourself? To shame your neighbors in front of everyone on the eve of the celebration, and then heroically drive out the monster? Was that your plan?",
["dlgIndia22Story_Sitaram_Win_1"]="I just wanted the demon to scare them. Every year, their harvest is the richest and their fields the greenest! While my harvest is of no use to anyone...",
["dlgIndia22Story_Sensei_Win"]="It's not magic that makes a garden blossom, it's hard work. And you're going to prove that yourself: Help your neighbors to restore their farm, or else...",
["dlgIndia22Story_Sitaram_Win_2"]="I'll do anything, my lord! Just don't leave me alone with that glutton!",
