["RAIDBOSS_LAMB"]="THE LAMB",
["MiniEventAnnounce"]="Since time immemorial, there has been living in the bowels of the earth a cult that monitors the delicate slumbers of the underworld gods and prevents them from waking. But the price for this is a cruel ritual battle fought to the last blood.",
["MiniEventStory_1"]="I see that you, Shadow, are strong and steadfast in spirit. The legends of your deeds are widespread. Would you like to become part of another?",
["MiniEventStory_2"]="The spirits of the underworld are wayward. We perform a ceremony to pacify their tempers – ritual battles! Your participation would be an honor for us.",
["MiniEventStory_EnterBattle"]="Aren't you a little sickly for such an arcane spectacle? And you chose this guy, seriously? This is a legend of a man? Oh, the spirits will be outraged...",
["MiniEventStory_Win_1"]="Well... Nobody comes to this arena by chance. You really are a man of legends, Shadow.",
["MiniEventStory_Win_2"]="It was a glorious fight! Yes, the spirits will grant us their fullest blessing! Now they can go back to sleep, pleasurably sated with human cruelty!",
["MiniEventStory_Loss_1"]="Yes, well... I want to believe that even the spirits have a sense of humor, and that they will just laugh at our fumbling in the arena, rather than unleashing their rage on us...",
["MiniEventStory_Loss_2"]="The legends lied, as I said they would. Pipsqueak, come back when your faith is stronger and can compete with steel!",
