["RitualBattleChest_0622"]="Ritual Chest",
["dlgAmericanEvent22Story_Sensei_1"]="The doors of my abode are open to any who are suffering. But it is unexpected to see a pirate within these walls... And where is your band of cutthroats, Puma?",
["dlgAmericanEvent22Story_Puma_1"]="In trouble, old man... I never thought the past of my people could follow me, but it has. So I ran to protect them. Please, hear me out!",
["dlgAmericanEvent22Story_May_1"]="She's absolutely frozen, Sensei! We can't throw her out with winds like these raging at the door...",
["dlgAmericanEvent22Story_Puma_2"]="Can you hear that too? When I was a child, a shaman told me about a spirit whose howl raised the waves and tore at the leaves. I never thought that old tale would turn out to be true!",
["dlgAmericanEvent22Story_Puma_3"]="He's coming this way to chase us with his cry until we fall down breathless... Just for sport! I don't know anywhere else to hide...",
["dlgAmericanEvent22Story_Wind_Wolf_1"]="I am the Wolf Wind! Whoever comes to meet me will be snuffed out like a candle! And sooner or later, I'll break down your door. It's just a question of time!",
["dlgAmericanEvent22Story_Sensei_2"]="The myths of the shamans are allegories. People invented sails to tame the wind, and since then it has served them. You're just a silly fairy tale, and Shadow will prove it!",
["dlgAmericanEvent22Story_Wind_Wolf_Lose"]="I shall how-ow-owl until the leaves cover the wreckage. No one will ever find the road here! Bold and stupid... How can you fight against the elements, humans?",
["dlgAmericanEvent22Story_Sensei_Lose"]="Shadow, remember the mighty cedars, which can withstand a hurricane but fall at the will of humans! Imagine that you're sinking your roots into the earth! And stand your ground!",
["dlgAmericanEvent22Story_Wind_Wolf_Win_1"]="What disgrace... You have taken my mighty voice! But your faith, girl, will bring me back to life... And I won't be coming alone! For we are many!",
["dlgAmericanEvent22Story_Puma_Win_1"]="The shaman said that in the legends, the leaves turned into birds, beautiful and free. We just have to wait, and I'm sure they'll return home.",
["dlgAmericanEvent22Story_May_Win_1"]="Look what's become of our beautiful garden... Total destruction! When will it ever blossom again?",
["dlgAmericanEvent22Story_Sensei_Win_2"]="Perhaps your shaman was right, Puma. A free bird is a symbol of renewal. You must become one too. Carry hope with you and leave the sea to the wind.",
